VISUAL: Text: "Vaultwarden", "66k stars. AGPL-3.0. Rust. Eight years of one man refusing to stop." with GitHub UI of Vaultwarden repo.
AUDIO: 'uncomfortable enough to change and it\'s now sitting at roughly 66,000 stars shipped under AGPL 3.0. The clients you already use don\'t know the difference.'

[00:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
