AUDIO: 'the day they need it. Two factor through Duo and YubiKey in its one-time password mode. Self-host this and that whole card is the default state. Worth being precise though, FIDO2'

[04:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'hardware keys already work on Bitwarden\'s free tier, so that part was never locked. What isn\'t in any Bitwarden tier at all is the admin back end, a separate page bolted on here for managing users and'

